{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Now this feels right. I do like to dabble in mixology every now and then. The best part of bartending is the stories. Do you know any good stories?\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:35:01.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744640379919401001","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Web grins to him and steps down from the stage, their spiders retreating back under their cloak somewhat. \"Didn't seem too phased by my spiders. Like that about you.\" They take a seat at the bar and think.","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:35:54.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744640603827994654","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Could tell you one Web's spin-mother liked.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:36:19.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744640709293899776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"No one ever thought the spider could ever amount to much. Thats how the spider always gets what it wants. Everyone always assumes that small means weak and dumb.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:37:17.156000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-16T19:37:30.616000Z","id":"744640949648621569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Web nods.","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:38:03.185000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641142708240404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He sets the drink down, and starts wiping down the bar.","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:38:13.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641186723135599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Lots to learn from small things often trod on.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:38:16.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641197007569016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Tell me that spin-mother story.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:39:09.448000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641420635275294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"and enjoy that drink.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:39:20.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641468148482070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Is much better in original Kraul, but cannot speak that tongue anymore\" Web says sadly. They begin to recite, taking small slow sips.","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:39:30.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744641508816453742","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Long ago, before the apes descended from trees and learned fire. Before many gods were even thoughts in small minds, there lived a spider. She was not strong or quick, but she was wise. She had raised many children but was now older and slower. Still, she desired one more clutch of eggs.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:41:48.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744642088619999373","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"She knew she would not find a mate, so she began to do the next best thing: spin her own egg sacs. So she spun. Day after day, night after night, she worked tirelessly. And when she had finished, she lay down for a long nap from which she expected not to wake up. She was wise, and believed that she could not will children into existence. So she slept for what she thought was the last time.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:44:44.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744642824733065348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"But several hours later, she heard a faint chirring beside her. She awoke, believing it to be another spider come to eat her in her weakened state. She would not die that way. They could have her body only wen she was done with it. But to her surprise, she awoke to see her eggs hatching. Bewildered, she looked around for an explanation.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:46:54.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744643369384542229","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"But she could see no way her eggs could have hatched. She waited patiently, and when they hatched she was amazed. Her new children glimmered with silvery threads and seemed made of dreams themselves. She quickly set about snaring prey for them to eat. When she had done so they ate happily and chirred to her: \"You are stronger than you know, dream-mother.\" She looked confused, but one of her new children touched their forehead to yours, and her old body began to crumble.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:50:28.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744644267825168524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"At first she was afraid, but she quickly realized that it did not hurt. When it was over, she looked to herself and saw a body like that of her new children: silvery, dream-like, immortal.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:51:24.210000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744644502450339892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Now she and her children wander the planes, bestowing blessings upon their kind and connections to others. Some lucky folk will find themselves with the spirit of one inside of them. And they are destined to make great works, and spin many weaves and stories, friend to spiders always.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:52:43.473000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744644834903719990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Web takes another sip from their drink. \"Ishka, spin-mother, used to tell Web that tale much. As reason for how Web have such strong connection to small friends.\" They grin to their spiders, and then to Fat Charlie.","created_at":"2020-08-16T19:53:54.325000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744645132078415923","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
